<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you for taking the time to contact us about our schedule.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><b><i><font size="2">-If cancelled route use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">I understand your disappointment that we are no longer flying to {!Case.Arrival_City__c}. We are constantly looking at the flights we offer to ensure they remain commercially viable. On some of the more leisure orientated routes, it is not always possible to operate Qantas services profitably, and in today’s competitive environment, it is just not feasible to operate services at a loss.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style="">We do appreciate your feedback about this change and I can assure you that your comments are passed through to our scheduling management, for use in our next review of this route.</font></p><font size="2" style=""><br></font><p style=""><b><i><font size="2">-If current schedule doesn’t meet needs use:-</font></i></b></p><font size="2" style=""><br></font><p style=""><font size="2">We are happy to add additional services to our timetable, if we believe they will be commercially viable, and are constantly monitoring the number of flights we operate on each of our routes. We are limited by the number of customers wanting to fly each week, but in today’s competitive environment it is just not feasible to operate services at a loss.</font></p><font size="2" style=""><br></font><p style=""><font size="2" style="">While we have no plans to increase our flight frequency between <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Departure_City__c}-</span>{!Case.Arrival_City__c} at the present time, I will make sure that your comments are passed on to our scheduling department for use in their next review of this route.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Thank you again for writing.</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Kind regards</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">{!User.FirstName}</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2">Qantas Customer Care</font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font size="2"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font size="2" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><br><br></font><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><span style="color: black; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><font size="2">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><font size="2">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>